- one query;
- multiple queries;
- UNION;
- CTE;
- subqueries;
- joins;
- any other SQLAlchemy mechanism.

That is the SQLAlchemy Query Programmer's responsibility.


## Grouping

When the request requires or clearly implies a breakdown, identify the required
